<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002T_S000D" variety="S000D">
<name>Other Electrical</name>
<ttl id="1002T_S000D_746SZ_T00DB" variety="T00DB">
<name>Hands-free System</name>
<para id="RM000001C4A01MX" category="J" type-id="304M2" name-id="CM0CN-19" from="200912">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Bluetooth telephone cannot receive calls or cannot connect</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000001C4A01MX_01" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ILF00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>Depending on the part replaced, setting work may be necessary. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001C3S022X"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001C4A01MX_02" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ILG00000">
<testtitle>Move Vehicle</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Move Vehicle</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>If the current position is outside the communication range, move the vehicle into the communication range and check whether the function returns to normal.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Function does not return to normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Function returns to normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0002" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0015" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ILH00000">
<testtitle>Move Cellular Phone</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check Cellular Phone Position</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Move the cellular phone close to the navigation receiver assembly and check whether the function returns to normal.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Function does not return to normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Function returns to normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0003" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0015" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ILI00000">
<testtitle>Check Model Used</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check Model Used</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check that the cellular phone used by the customer is a Bluetooth compatible cellular phone whose operation has been verified.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Model whose operation has been verified</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If the cellular phone being used is not a model whose operation has been verified, inform the customer. (Compatible models can be checked at G-BOOK.com on the Internet)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0004" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0016" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ILJ00000">
<testtitle>Check Bluetooth Setting Procedure</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check Bluetooth Setting Procedure</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check that the phone has been registered using the correct procedure.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Registered using the correct procedure</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Not registered using the correct procedure</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0005" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0017" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ILK00000">
<testtitle>Turn Power Source Off and On Again</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn Power Source Off and On Again</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn the cellular phone power OFF once, and then turn it ON again.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Turn the ignition switch off, and then turn it to ACC again.</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check the problem symptom and check whether the function returns to normal.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Function does not return to normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Function returns to normal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0006" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0015" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ILL00000">
<testtitle>Cellular Phone Call</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that normal calls can be made with the cellular phone by itself.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Calls can be made normally</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
<atten4>
<ptxt>If there is a problem with the cellular phone, contact the customer and ask them to have the cellular phone checked.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0007" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0016" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0007" proc-id="RM0550J___0000ILM00000">
<testtitle>Replace Cellular Phone</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>With the customer's permission, connect a staff member's Bluetooth compatible cellular phone.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Following the owner's manual, register and connect the Bluetooth cellular phone.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check that a call can be made.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Calls cannot be made normally</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Calls can be made normally</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If there is a problem with the cellular phone, contact the customer and ask them to have the cellular phone checked.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>After the inspection is complete, delete the registered cellular phone and the history of telephone numbers used for the inspection.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0014" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0016" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0014">
<testtitle>Replace Navigation Receiver Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001XG5006X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0015">
<testtitle>END</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0016">
<testtitle>Replace Cellular Phone</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001C4A01MX_02_0017">
<testtitle>Re-register</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>